  "prefLabel": "Env-A 2907.14 Quarterly Reporting",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-A 2907.14 Quarterly Reporting. Each affected source shall submit the data required pursuant to Env-A 2907.12 and Env-A 2907.13 to EPA as part of the quarterly reports submitted to EPA for the purpose of compliance with 40 CFR 75.\n\nSource. #10002, eff 10-1-11 (formerly Env-A 2911.03); ss by #12995, eff 2-25-20",
